Fields: target, definition metadata, root control reference.
initialize: empty column definition; lazy root.
target: read/replace inspected receiver. effectiveReceiver returns target. view returns self.
root: lazily convert stored layout to live controls; root: attach an unowned control tree.
definition: export current live control tree with identities and view metadata.
definition: (setter): validate and reconcile JSON into native controls, preserving compatible IDs and extra properties.
inspectorMetadata: editable definition plus root reference.
